<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Welcome</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 500px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
      .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
<h2>Welcome to CampusFlow - University Management System, <%= name %>!</h2>

<p>
    Thank you for joining CampusFlow. Your account has been created
    successfully, and we're excited to have you as part of our
    academic community.
</p>

<p>
    CampusFlow helps you manage your university experience in one place.
    You can access academic information, manage your profile,
    explore courses, stay connected with instructors, and
    access essential university services.
</p>

<p>
    Your account is ready. Log in to CampusFlow and get started
    with a smarter, more connected university experience.
</p>

<div class="footer">
    &copy; CampusFlow - University Management System. All rights reserved.
</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>